WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.900
Your business runs on relationships. And on five different jobs.

00:04.100 --> 00:07.300
ONE GO runs your day, in points.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.700
ONE MOVE holds every relationship you have.

00:10.900 --> 00:14.100
Marquee markets every listing.

00:14.300 --> 00:17.500
Showly runs every buyer tour.

00:17.700 --> 00:20.900
And ONE Open runs every open house.

00:21.100 --> 00:24.500
In the middle, one brain that sees all five.

00:24.700 --> 00:30.100
Every morning, ONE tells you exactly what to do today, and when.

00:30.300 --> 00:34.500
Open ONE. Do the first thing. Call Jen.

00:34.700 --> 00:38.500
Then the next. Two video texts.

00:38.700 --> 00:42.900
ONE is watching all day, across all five products.

00:43.100 --> 00:46.700
By four, everything's done.

00:46.900 --> 00:51.500
And at the end of the day, ONE compiles it for you.

00:51.700 --> 00:55.300
Open ONE. Do the work. It's that simple.

00:55.500 --> 01:00.900
Ask ONE anything. Who should I call today? It answers, and tells you why.

01:01.100 --> 01:05.100
When a buyer answers your tour, ONE knows right away.

01:05.300 --> 01:09.500
Every listing, step by step. Nothing posts until you approve it.

01:09.700 --> 01:13.900
Every open house, in four phases. Plan, prepare, host, follow up.

01:14.100 --> 01:16.900
Now follow one person through all five.

01:17.100 --> 01:20.500
Mark signs in at your open house.

01:20.700 --> 01:24.100
He lands in ONE MOVE, tagged where you met him.

01:24.300 --> 01:27.700
ONE suggests the follow-up. You say yes.

01:27.900 --> 01:31.100
You tour homes together. He answers on each.

01:31.300 --> 01:34.300
Yes to 742 Willow Lane.

01:34.500 --> 01:38.500
So ONE says: call Mark today. And here's why.

01:38.700 --> 01:43.500
Slide forward and see what's coming, before it sneaks up on you.

01:43.700 --> 01:47.900
And your goals. On pace, or not. Every morning.

01:48.100 --> 01:52.900
One relationship. Five products. One connected system. That's ONE.
